WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:38.800
EPISODE 14

01:42.080 --> 01:44.480
Cousin, Yuanming, listen to me!

01:44.560 --> 01:45.800
Explain? You traitor!

01:45.880 --> 01:47.080
- I…
- Traitor!

01:47.160 --> 01:49.280
I'm a spy, really!

01:49.360 --> 01:50.200
A spy?

01:50.280 --> 01:51.560
Yes, hear me out!

01:51.640 --> 01:53.280
I'm undercover. Trust me!

01:53.360 --> 01:54.520
Cousin, listen to me!

01:55.040 --> 01:56.440
Cousin, Yuanming!

01:56.520 --> 01:58.920
Think about the Li women.

01:59.000 --> 02:01.440
None of them are easy to deal with.

02:02.240 --> 02:04.200
I took the risk for the bigger picture.

02:04.280 --> 02:05.800
And for who?

02:05.880 --> 02:08.160
For you two!

02:09.040 --> 02:12.000
With me spying, I'll pass the news.

02:12.080 --> 02:14.800
You'll sleep easy.

02:14.880 --> 02:15.800
Fan Lianghan!

02:15.880 --> 02:17.400
So what?

02:17.480 --> 02:19.280
I'm her favorite son-in-law now.

02:19.360 --> 02:20.320
You two are finished!

02:21.240 --> 02:22.080
Fan Lianghan, you!

02:22.160 --> 02:23.280
Stop!

02:23.360 --> 02:24.920
Shameless fool!

02:25.000 --> 02:27.240
Yuanming, he's always like this.

02:27.320 --> 02:28.760
Don't bother with him.

02:29.640 --> 02:32.240
Mr. Chai, it's not about that.

02:32.840 --> 02:35.280
I've been thinking about Shouhua's riddle.

02:35.360 --> 02:36.360
"Four fight for the path."

02:36.440 --> 02:38.160
Not a poem, not a puzzle.

02:38.760 --> 02:39.880
What is it?

02:40.520 --> 02:43.480
I keep thinking, but no clue.

02:44.760 --> 02:46.800
These riddles? I'm lost.

02:46.880 --> 02:49.760
I just know she set a trap.

02:49.840 --> 02:51.880
Trapped all four fops in one go.

02:51.960 --> 02:53.720
Anyone can see it.

02:53.800 --> 02:55.760
They weren't after treasure.

02:55.840 --> 02:57.360
They wanted women!

02:58.040 --> 03:00.560
She's just and ruthless.

03:00.640 --> 03:02.080
Who'd dare mess with her?

03:02.160 --> 03:03.600
Rumors will die out themselves.

03:06.320 --> 03:10.480
Buddy, with her wit and boldness,

03:10.560 --> 03:11.840
do you still dare take her?

03:12.440 --> 03:13.560
Hold on, Mr. Chai.

03:14.120 --> 03:15.080
What did you just say?

03:15.160 --> 03:17.200
I asked if you'd still answer her riddle.

03:17.280 --> 03:18.280
It's not too late to back out.

03:18.360 --> 03:20.720
No, before that!

03:23.240 --> 03:28.840
I said she trapped all the fops.

03:29.960 --> 03:31.520
- That's it! That's it!
- What's the matter?

03:31.600 --> 03:33.840
Yes, exactly that!

03:33.920 --> 03:36.520
Mr. Chai, thanks for clearing that up.

03:37.120 --> 03:38.600
I'll repay you another day.

03:38.680 --> 03:40.040
Yuanming! Yuanming!

03:40.120 --> 03:41.200
Yuanming!

03:44.040 --> 03:45.000
What did I just say?

04:19.160 --> 04:21.280
Shouhua, I've solved it.

04:27.480 --> 04:31.200
Huangfu Mei wrote
in Records of Three Waters

04:32.080 --> 04:35.800
about Queyao, the servant of Li Yu,

04:35.880 --> 04:36.720
Governor of Hunan.

04:37.640 --> 04:39.760
She was too smart and pretty,

04:39.840 --> 04:42.520
drawing trouble from Li's sons.

04:43.280 --> 04:45.720
One night, she called all four of them.

04:45.800 --> 04:48.960
She placed them in separate corners.

04:49.040 --> 04:50.520
Then she exposed them

04:50.600 --> 04:51.840
and scolded them harshly.

04:51.920 --> 04:53.960
Ashamed, they fled and never dared again.

04:54.920 --> 04:57.480
Unknowingly, you mirrored this tale.

04:57.560 --> 05:01.440
Shouhua, did I get it right?

05:02.880 --> 05:04.440
You're exactly right.

05:05.880 --> 05:08.360
Where are the four?

05:11.760 --> 05:12.880
What are you doing?

05:17.000 --> 05:20.040
Hang them in the woods till morning.

05:20.120 --> 05:23.480
Let them down at dawn.

05:23.560 --> 05:24.680
Got it.

05:24.760 --> 05:26.680
Master! Master!

05:26.760 --> 05:28.280
Spare us, please!

05:28.360 --> 05:29.880
Help!

05:30.600 --> 05:33.720
Since you asked, how could I refuse?

05:34.480 --> 05:37.720
I gave them a good talk
about mending their ways.

05:38.520 --> 05:40.520
I have a gift for you.

05:43.760 --> 05:47.320
Shouhua. I've come by
a rare sandalwood fan.

05:47.400 --> 05:50.760
A tribute from foreign lands,
seldom seen here.

05:51.640 --> 05:53.520
I know you adore pear blossoms,

05:53.600 --> 05:56.880
so I painted them upon it.

05:57.480 --> 05:59.080
Please accept it.

06:11.320 --> 06:12.720
Soft hands hold the fan.

06:13.720 --> 06:15.560
Scents drift under blooms.

06:16.600 --> 06:18.720
May it stay by your side always.

06:19.760 --> 06:21.240
And may you remember

06:22.200 --> 06:23.960
the heart behind it.

06:26.600 --> 06:30.320
Can you truly part with such a treasure?

06:32.040 --> 06:35.440
I await your next challenge.

06:39.360 --> 06:42.400
Then, follow me.

06:56.400 --> 06:58.520
This Bian River before us flows

06:58.600 --> 07:00.520
from Bian Bridge at West Water Gate

07:01.120 --> 07:02.400
past Floating,

07:02.480 --> 07:03.560
Jinliang,

07:03.640 --> 07:05.120
and Xingguo Bridges,

07:05.200 --> 07:07.560
to reach this very spot.

07:07.640 --> 07:08.680
Further east,

07:09.320 --> 07:11.040
it winds past Iron Buddha Temple,

07:11.120 --> 07:13.440
Chunming Market, and Guangji Granary,

07:14.400 --> 07:15.760
beyond the Great Gate,

07:16.320 --> 07:17.680
to the river's mouth.

07:19.720 --> 07:21.520
It drifts eastward,

07:22.120 --> 07:23.880
like spring days,

07:24.640 --> 07:25.800
gone forever.

07:26.400 --> 07:29.360
Look at the endless line
of boats before us,

07:29.440 --> 07:31.040
linking seas and lands,

07:31.120 --> 07:32.640
spanning the empire.

07:32.720 --> 07:36.560
It brings life and wealth
to countless souls.

07:37.480 --> 07:40.040
This is the very lifeline of our Song.

07:40.800 --> 07:43.960
Shouhua,
the past spring is not worth grieving,

07:44.040 --> 07:46.560
for next year's will be gentler still.

07:47.240 --> 07:50.400
Why dwell in sorrow?

08:00.520 --> 08:02.200
Well said.

08:03.000 --> 08:03.960
Watch carefully.

08:08.320 --> 08:09.640
Shouhua, you…

08:10.320 --> 08:11.760
You said

08:11.840 --> 08:13.800
the past is nothing to grieve,

08:14.520 --> 08:16.200
but I hold on to the past.

08:16.840 --> 08:19.360
Not just that. I never forget a slight.

08:20.440 --> 08:23.000
You shamed me on our wedding night,

08:23.520 --> 08:24.760
made a fool out of me,

08:25.400 --> 08:26.920
and caused me trouble.

08:27.000 --> 08:29.560
So, now I throw this fan into the river.

08:30.160 --> 08:33.200
If you can undo the past
and return the fan,

08:33.880 --> 08:36.680
we may yet repair this marriage.

08:37.280 --> 08:40.240
You're asking me to fish it out?

08:46.680 --> 08:48.360
But that's impossible!

08:48.440 --> 08:51.160
Shouhua, please, wait!

08:51.240 --> 08:52.160
Shouhua!

08:52.240 --> 08:53.360
How could that be possible?

08:54.200 --> 08:55.360
Shouhua!

08:55.440 --> 08:56.600
Shouhua!

09:10.120 --> 09:10.960
Look at him.

09:11.040 --> 09:12.360
He's lost the will to live.

09:12.440 --> 09:14.240
- He's not jumping to…
- You're young.

09:14.320 --> 09:16.280
- Don't be reckless!
- Don't do anything rash!

09:16.360 --> 09:17.440
You're young.

09:17.520 --> 09:18.840
What can't you overcome?

09:18.920 --> 09:20.000
- Yeah.
- Wait till you're old.

09:20.080 --> 09:22.880
Even Yama won't take you without a fight.

09:22.960 --> 09:25.160
They should cover this river.

09:25.240 --> 09:26.640
Too many fools by the water.

09:26.720 --> 09:28.880
If you're giving up,

09:28.960 --> 09:31.960
leave me your boots and robes.

09:32.040 --> 09:33.600
How could you say that?

09:34.120 --> 09:35.360
- Shoo, shoo!
- Just a joke!

09:35.440 --> 09:36.680
Out of the way.

09:37.680 --> 09:38.800
Stop causing trouble.

09:42.240 --> 09:43.680
So, it really is Mr. Du.

09:43.760 --> 09:45.120
I thought I was seeing things.

09:45.200 --> 09:48.320
Come. Tell me what's troubling you.

09:49.520 --> 09:51.120
Shouhua dropped her fan.

09:51.640 --> 09:52.760
She wants me to fetch it.

09:53.360 --> 09:55.760
If I do, we stay married.

09:55.840 --> 09:59.080
If not, I'm out the door.

10:03.360 --> 10:04.920
Why didn't you say so earlier?

10:05.000 --> 10:05.960
I've got an idea!

10:07.120 --> 10:08.320
You do?

10:10.240 --> 10:12.000
What is it? Tell me.

10:12.080 --> 10:13.400
I'll fish it out for you.

10:15.680 --> 10:18.200
Quick, borrow a net from the boatman!

10:19.320 --> 10:20.880
Hurry. Go on!

10:20.960 --> 10:22.200
- Move it!
- Faster!

10:24.680 --> 10:25.880
Wait for me! I'll be right back.

10:29.920 --> 10:31.280
Check carefully!

10:31.360 --> 10:33.200
What about there? Anything inside?

10:33.280 --> 10:34.560
Nothing.

10:34.640 --> 10:36.280
Then there! Is it there?

10:37.120 --> 10:38.360
Quick, there! Here. Check here!

10:38.440 --> 10:40.840
Yes, right here! This spot!

10:40.920 --> 10:42.320
Search thoroughly!

10:43.360 --> 10:45.200
We'll find it. Here, here!

10:45.280 --> 10:47.160
There, there! That spot!

10:47.240 --> 10:48.400
Carefully!

10:48.480 --> 10:50.320
No way. We won't find it!

10:50.400 --> 10:52.640
Here, here! Listen to me.

10:52.720 --> 10:56.360
I'm second-best at fishing,
and no one in Bianjing dares claim first!

10:57.080 --> 10:59.760
Don't worry, I'll get it before sunset.

11:00.360 --> 11:01.360
Mr. Du,

11:01.440 --> 11:03.520
I'm truly sincere!

11:03.600 --> 11:05.800
This alliance needs me.

11:05.880 --> 11:07.520
You can't let my cousin kick me out!

11:08.160 --> 11:09.120
Mr. Fan,

11:10.160 --> 11:12.200
the fan fell in an hour ago.

11:12.280 --> 11:14.480
It's probably long gone with the current.

11:15.120 --> 11:16.960
Right. How did I forget that?

11:17.800 --> 11:20.040
Pack up! Let's move!

11:20.120 --> 11:21.440
Master, where to now?

11:21.520 --> 11:24.560
Fool,
haven't you heard of marking the boat?

11:24.640 --> 11:26.480
Where does the Bian River flow?

11:26.560 --> 11:28.240
Head to Bian Bridge.

11:28.320 --> 11:30.560
When the fan floats by,
I'll grab it there!

11:31.160 --> 11:32.000
Yes!

11:32.080 --> 11:33.760
Pack up! Pack up!

11:33.840 --> 11:35.000
Alright, pack up!

11:35.080 --> 11:36.360
You too.

11:41.560 --> 11:43.600
Hurry up! Pack it up. Let's head home!

11:43.680 --> 11:44.640
Go home?

11:44.720 --> 11:46.720
Master, we're not going to the bridge?

11:46.800 --> 11:48.280
Just teasing him.

11:48.360 --> 11:49.680
You think I'm that dumb?

11:52.280 --> 11:53.480
Shouhua,

11:54.040 --> 11:56.480
what do you think of these?

11:57.280 --> 11:58.360
Take your pick.

11:59.120 --> 12:00.080
What's this for?

12:00.160 --> 12:03.880
Aren't you leaving Mr. Du?

12:03.960 --> 12:04.880
Better safe than sorry.

12:06.400 --> 12:08.280
Married women these days,

12:08.360 --> 12:13.400
always meddling and matchmaking.

12:14.040 --> 12:18.560
Maybe life's good,
so they want others to share.

12:18.640 --> 12:22.320
The unhappy ones
drag others into their misery.

12:23.320 --> 12:25.200
Kangning, you look great.

12:25.280 --> 12:27.560
I'd say your husband is doting on you,

12:27.640 --> 12:29.400
serving you with care.

12:29.480 --> 12:31.080
No need to tease me.

12:32.000 --> 12:34.800
I was joking with you.

12:34.880 --> 12:36.040
Don't take it seriously.

12:36.920 --> 12:40.560
These are matches
my mother found for Qiongnu.

12:40.640 --> 12:43.600
You're still in the Du Family,
and if I pick for you,

12:43.680 --> 12:45.360
are you not afraid
Mr. Du will throw me out?

12:45.440 --> 12:47.760
No rush for Qiongnu either.

12:48.400 --> 12:49.600
Mother seems to think that

12:49.680 --> 12:52.960
she or Haode will stay
to keep the family together.

12:53.680 --> 12:56.640
Likely marry someone into the family.

12:57.240 --> 12:59.400
These don't seem right.

13:00.000 --> 13:00.880
Marrying in?

13:00.960 --> 13:02.960
Marrying in is never easy.

13:03.040 --> 13:06.800
Honest ones are plenty.

13:06.880 --> 13:08.680
Good matches are rare.

13:09.320 --> 13:10.720
Take your time.

13:11.680 --> 13:13.160
Indeed.

13:16.040 --> 13:19.360
The restaurant got fine fresh fish today,

13:19.440 --> 13:20.760
and some's been sent home.

13:21.320 --> 13:24.280
My husband hired a chef
to make fish for Mother at home.

13:24.880 --> 13:26.880
Didn't you say raw fish was too strong?

13:26.960 --> 13:28.240
Today, I'm treating.

13:28.320 --> 13:30.760
Meet me at Pan Restaurant
for something new.

13:31.480 --> 13:33.560
I can't leave my mother-in-law alone.

13:34.160 --> 13:36.200
She's been invited by Mother.

13:36.280 --> 13:38.640
They're enjoying fish slices now.

13:39.280 --> 13:40.920
Go and enjoy yourself.

13:43.240 --> 13:47.640
With your kindness,
playing the hostess now,

13:47.720 --> 13:50.240
I'll gladly follow your lead.

13:52.800 --> 13:54.320
After you.

13:54.400 --> 13:55.520
Please, have a seat.

14:04.600 --> 14:05.600
Shouhua, what's so funny?

14:06.320 --> 14:08.360
Seeing your husband so humble

14:08.440 --> 14:11.080
reminded me of a joke with Kangning,

14:11.680 --> 14:13.160
which made it even funnier.

14:15.640 --> 14:17.680
Your meddling caused all this fuss.

14:18.320 --> 14:20.040
Yes, yes, you're right.

14:20.680 --> 14:22.000
I said it before.

14:22.080 --> 14:25.080
She likes to do the matchmaking now.

14:25.160 --> 14:27.400
The cause lies with her husband.

14:28.400 --> 14:30.200
When did Kangning ever match make?

14:30.280 --> 14:31.840
I'm more confused now.

14:35.600 --> 14:36.560
Someone!

15:04.960 --> 15:06.080
Shouhua, Fuhui,

15:06.160 --> 15:07.320
my marriage with Kangning

15:07.400 --> 15:08.520
had its twists and turns.

15:08.600 --> 15:10.120
It's all thanks to your kindness.

15:10.200 --> 15:12.160
I'll never forget it.

15:12.240 --> 15:14.280
This wine is hardly enough to repay you.

15:16.080 --> 15:18.880
Mr. Chai, let me tell you the truth.

15:19.720 --> 15:21.920
The Chai family's back-and-forth…

15:22.000 --> 15:23.120
We were against it.

15:23.200 --> 15:25.840
You should thank your wife.

15:26.520 --> 15:29.200
Through fire and water, she stood firm.

15:29.280 --> 15:31.680
She'd rather die than marry another.

15:32.280 --> 15:36.880
Your union must've been heaven's will.

15:36.960 --> 15:39.600
Her devotion is rare in this world.

15:40.200 --> 15:42.960
Mistreat her, and we won't let it slide.

15:44.560 --> 15:45.880
I'll remember your words.

15:46.600 --> 15:48.520
Kangning, another toast to you.

15:48.600 --> 15:49.920
Enough.

15:50.000 --> 15:51.680
I'm here to drink with my sisters.

15:51.760 --> 15:52.720
Don't get in the way.

15:52.800 --> 15:54.280
- Alright, alright.
- Off you go!

15:55.280 --> 15:57.120
Relax. I'll excuse myself.

16:03.800 --> 16:05.640
He should thank Shouhua.

16:05.720 --> 16:08.080
If you hadn't taken her spot,

16:08.680 --> 16:10.280
how would he have such a fine wife today?

16:10.880 --> 16:12.360
It was hard on Shouhua.

16:12.440 --> 16:15.720
Mr. Du may be talented and promising,

16:16.240 --> 16:19.000
but he's a thorny flower, hard to swallow.

16:19.840 --> 16:22.560
You can't stand him or let go.

16:22.640 --> 16:23.840
It's maddening.

16:30.320 --> 16:31.400
Shouhua,

16:31.480 --> 16:35.160
a fisherman caught
an eight-catty fish from Bian River.

16:35.240 --> 16:38.280
Knowing you love fish,
we saved it for you.

16:38.360 --> 16:39.880
Try it.

16:42.240 --> 16:43.120
The meat's the finest.

16:52.880 --> 16:56.280
Strange. How does a fan
end up in a fish, Shouhua?

17:00.640 --> 17:01.920
Shouhua.

17:08.240 --> 17:09.320
Such a coincidence!

17:09.400 --> 17:13.000
The fan in the fish,
landing right before you.

17:13.640 --> 17:17.000
Surely heaven's will, reuniting us.

17:17.080 --> 17:19.520
Shouhua, did I pass?

17:26.480 --> 17:27.920
Fine,

17:28.000 --> 17:30.280
when Mother was busy,

17:30.360 --> 17:32.480
who cared for you like a mother?

17:33.120 --> 17:37.440
Now you all team up with outsiders
to trick me.

17:38.040 --> 17:39.440
You…

17:40.400 --> 17:42.040
Do you think that's fair?

17:42.720 --> 17:44.880
Shouhua, I knew nothing!

17:48.800 --> 17:49.840
I…

17:49.920 --> 17:51.560
- Shouhua!
- Shouhua!

17:55.000 --> 17:56.120
Shouhua!

17:57.000 --> 17:58.040
Shouhua!

17:58.120 --> 18:00.440
Kangning, how is it?
Is the food to your taste?

18:00.520 --> 18:02.000
I said this wouldn't work!

18:02.080 --> 18:03.840
Shouhua doesn't listen, yet you did this.

18:03.920 --> 18:06.040
Now I'm the one scolded.

18:06.720 --> 18:09.000
Kangning! Kangning!

18:11.000 --> 18:12.080
What…

18:13.000 --> 18:14.880
What's going on here?

18:25.080 --> 18:26.160
You said

18:26.760 --> 18:28.160
if I got the fan,

18:28.880 --> 18:30.000
I'd pass.

18:30.080 --> 18:32.240
I hope you'll keep your word.

18:32.840 --> 18:34.560
I would,

18:34.640 --> 18:36.560
but someone's too sly.

18:37.160 --> 18:38.920
I doubt this is the same fan.

18:39.480 --> 18:42.400
If you made one, you can make another.

18:42.480 --> 18:45.600
Rare fans don't appear in pairs.

18:45.680 --> 18:47.240
Not necessarily.

18:47.840 --> 18:50.080
Envoys pass through often.

18:50.160 --> 18:52.240
These treasures turn into casual gifts.

18:52.840 --> 18:53.840
You've got one.

18:54.640 --> 18:56.360
What about the second-ranked scholar?

18:56.440 --> 18:57.560
The top scholar?

18:57.640 --> 18:59.320
Even if not,

18:59.400 --> 19:01.320
no craftsmen could copy it?

19:02.240 --> 19:03.840
Plenty of ways to trick me.

19:04.400 --> 19:05.680
So, Shouhua,

19:05.760 --> 19:08.680
how will you prove it's not the same?

19:09.360 --> 19:10.200
You!

19:11.400 --> 19:14.120
So, you're out of words for once.

19:14.720 --> 19:16.280
My fault.

19:18.040 --> 19:20.000
I should've marked it.

19:20.080 --> 19:21.440
Now you've got the upper hand.

19:23.840 --> 19:25.120
Fine.

19:25.200 --> 19:26.440
I'll take this as a pass.

19:27.560 --> 19:28.680
Thank you.

19:37.240 --> 19:38.960
You scold me…

19:41.920 --> 19:43.520
yet still make me shoes.

19:49.440 --> 19:51.040
What a fine wife I've married.

19:51.680 --> 19:53.080
Yet I failed to cherish you.

19:53.960 --> 19:55.120
I deserve a beating.

19:55.200 --> 19:56.760
No wonder you're angry with me.

19:58.760 --> 19:59.760
Let me try.

20:10.320 --> 20:11.520
This…

20:17.240 --> 20:18.680
In a few days,

20:18.760 --> 20:20.240
it's my late husband's memorial.

20:21.360 --> 20:24.560
By custom, I make a pair to burn.

20:30.240 --> 20:31.160
They're for him.

20:31.240 --> 20:34.200
If you like, I'll make you a pair too.

20:38.960 --> 20:39.800
What's wrong?

20:40.480 --> 20:41.760
You're so clever

20:42.640 --> 20:43.880
yet you don't see what's wrong?

20:45.840 --> 20:47.800
No wonder you've been so cold lately.

20:47.880 --> 20:51.720
Turns out, you're still thinking of him.

21:11.000 --> 21:12.800
Why can't I confront her?

21:12.880 --> 21:15.160
She could sell fish, meat, medicine,

21:15.240 --> 21:16.640
or wine, but no,

21:16.720 --> 21:21.400
she had to open
a tea house across from us.

21:21.480 --> 21:22.320
What's her plan?

21:23.240 --> 21:26.600
Alright, Mother. Sit, Mother. Calm down.

21:27.480 --> 21:30.040
Mother, they sell staple foods.

21:30.120 --> 21:31.240
We sell tea.

21:31.320 --> 21:32.680
It's not the same.

21:33.880 --> 21:35.200
Who says it's not?

21:35.800 --> 21:37.200
Other shops split trades.

21:37.280 --> 21:38.320
Cui's does both.

21:39.200 --> 21:40.480
I saw it.

21:41.120 --> 21:43.040
They use silver teapots!

21:43.120 --> 21:45.440
Tea for a coin, ruining prices!

21:45.520 --> 21:47.160
Go scold her.

21:47.680 --> 21:49.080
Afraid of her?

21:49.160 --> 21:51.320
Don't add to the flames.

21:52.240 --> 21:53.880
Then pour water to kill our spirit?

21:54.640 --> 21:56.240
You're just scared.

21:59.240 --> 22:00.200
Mother,

22:00.280 --> 22:01.800
her shop is her business.

22:02.480 --> 22:04.240
The excitement won't last three days.

22:04.320 --> 22:06.760
A losing trade won't last long.

22:07.600 --> 22:09.640
We mind our own trade.

22:09.720 --> 22:11.000
Why bother with her?

22:11.080 --> 22:13.920
But she sells whatever we sell.

22:14.480 --> 22:16.360
She's stealing business right at our door!

22:16.440 --> 22:18.640
Can I just leave it be?

22:18.720 --> 22:20.840
Mother has long run this shop in Bianjing.

22:20.920 --> 22:22.800
Sifu House is well-known.

22:22.880 --> 22:25.480
Everyone calls you Boss Li with respect.

22:26.040 --> 22:28.960
If you scold her, won't people gossip?

22:29.040 --> 22:32.840
They'll say, "Cui's opened on the street.

22:32.920 --> 22:35.440
Boss Li of Sifu House couldn't stay calm!"

22:35.520 --> 22:36.600
Exactly.

22:36.680 --> 22:37.640
By then,

22:37.720 --> 22:40.200
everyone will go to Cui's
to watch the drama.

22:40.280 --> 22:41.280
I won't let you go

22:41.360 --> 22:43.640
because I won't let you
work for their benefit.

22:46.160 --> 22:47.880
That makes sense.

22:51.840 --> 22:53.680
I almost fell for her trick!

22:53.760 --> 22:55.400
That sly old fox!

22:55.480 --> 22:57.440
That wretched hag, nonsense!

23:00.760 --> 23:02.000
What is this?

23:11.080 --> 23:12.640
PAINTED BY DU YUANMING

23:15.200 --> 23:16.120
Mother?

23:17.720 --> 23:18.960
Mother.

23:25.040 --> 23:26.080
What's this?

23:40.840 --> 23:46.160
A wealthy Wang offered 300 strings
for Yangxi's painting.

23:46.240 --> 23:48.520
I thought, 300 strings.

23:48.600 --> 23:49.760
It's real money!

23:49.840 --> 23:51.680
Who would turn that down, right?

23:51.760 --> 23:53.920
Only a fool would!

23:54.920 --> 23:57.680
Mother, how many times have I said this?

23:57.760 --> 23:59.080
If you need money, come to me.

23:59.160 --> 24:00.480
Don't go to Du Yangxi.

24:01.000 --> 24:02.680
Do not speak like he is a stranger.

24:02.760 --> 24:06.320
He's your husband,
my son-in-law, isn't he?

24:06.920 --> 24:08.800
When he was down and out,

24:08.880 --> 24:09.920
I saved his life.

24:10.000 --> 24:12.320
And I gave him my own daughter.

24:12.400 --> 24:14.400
Now that he's rich,

24:14.480 --> 24:16.080
can't he show some respect?

24:16.920 --> 24:21.160
I didn't beg for this painting.

24:21.240 --> 24:23.800
He gave it willingly.

24:25.120 --> 24:26.440
Mother,

24:26.520 --> 24:29.480
even court painters of Xiangguo Temple

24:29.560 --> 24:31.400
sell for no more than a thousand.

24:31.480 --> 24:34.320
Wu Daozi's murals from the last dynasty

24:34.400 --> 24:35.640
are worth just 300 strings.

24:36.360 --> 24:39.360
No matter how good his work is,
it's not beyond the Painting Sage.

24:40.240 --> 24:42.280
They're not after the painting.

24:42.360 --> 24:44.000
They're just looking for connections.

24:45.200 --> 24:47.160
That's the way of the world.

24:47.240 --> 24:48.680
Nothing strange about it.

24:52.480 --> 24:54.680
I know you're above all this.

24:54.760 --> 24:56.400
I won't ask again.

25:00.760 --> 25:02.640
Fine, fine. I'll return this one too.

25:02.720 --> 25:03.800
- Here.
- This way.

25:05.000 --> 25:06.680
Mother, Shouhua…

25:09.680 --> 25:11.040
I've brought her here.

25:11.840 --> 25:13.560
Chou'er, greet Mrs. Du.

25:14.400 --> 25:15.680
Greetings, Mrs. Du.

25:16.720 --> 25:18.760
What a tidy little one.

25:19.520 --> 25:22.360
But how did you end up with this name?

25:23.000 --> 25:24.960
I had scabs as a child

25:25.040 --> 25:27.240
and lost all my hair.

25:27.920 --> 25:29.840
So, they called me Chou'er, meaning ugly.

25:30.600 --> 25:32.560
But I grew out of it.

25:33.920 --> 25:35.400
My father said,

25:35.480 --> 25:37.680
"Her heart's kind, not her name.

25:37.760 --> 25:39.360
She's handy but not a talker."

25:40.280 --> 25:43.680
I'll keep my head down and serve Mrs. Du.

25:44.760 --> 25:47.240
Mother picked her after seeing over ten.

25:47.840 --> 25:51.160
She's perfect at housework.
And she's quick-witted.

25:51.240 --> 25:54.600
Shouhua, she can be your helper too.

25:54.680 --> 25:55.960
Take her home today.

25:57.640 --> 25:58.960
Mother, you've worked hard for me.

26:00.200 --> 26:02.080
Who else would care for you like I do?

26:04.200 --> 26:05.840
Chou'er, you've greeted her.

26:05.920 --> 26:08.200
Come, I've got something to tell you.

26:13.680 --> 26:14.680
Shouhua,

26:15.560 --> 26:19.440
I know you're still
thinking of the one before.

26:19.520 --> 26:20.520
Indeed.

26:20.600 --> 26:22.200
Master Shiyi was truly exceptional.

26:23.080 --> 26:24.760
His character and talent,

26:24.840 --> 26:26.440
his grace refined,

26:26.520 --> 26:28.440
his bearing extraordinary.

26:29.040 --> 26:32.160
And he treated you so well.

26:32.240 --> 26:33.680
But he had one flaw.

26:34.800 --> 26:35.920
His life was too short!

26:37.040 --> 26:37.960
Mother!

26:38.960 --> 26:41.080
You said you'd mourn him for three years,

26:41.160 --> 26:42.920
and I let you.

26:44.400 --> 26:46.680
Master Shiyi was a noble man,

26:46.760 --> 26:49.440
but Mr. Du is also an excellent match.

26:49.960 --> 26:52.040
How is he not good enough for you?

26:54.600 --> 26:55.600
Shouhua,

26:55.680 --> 26:56.800
from now on,

26:56.880 --> 26:58.960
let go of your sorrow,

26:59.040 --> 27:00.680
open your heart,

27:00.760 --> 27:03.720
and live well with your husband.

27:05.720 --> 27:09.360
When you're my age, you'll understand.

27:09.440 --> 27:12.360
The past, no matter how good,

27:12.960 --> 27:14.680
is just a memory.

27:14.760 --> 27:17.760
What matters is the one before you now.

27:18.440 --> 27:20.640
That's what lasts.

27:21.680 --> 27:22.800
Mother,

27:23.880 --> 27:26.200
Master Shiyi was kind to our family.

27:26.280 --> 27:27.920
I always feel guilty.

27:28.880 --> 27:32.200
But when I face Mr. Du,

27:32.280 --> 27:33.960
I don't know what to do.

27:35.040 --> 27:38.200
I've never met anyone like him.

27:43.720 --> 27:45.840
- Cousin.
- Why are they back again?

27:46.680 --> 27:48.640
Cousin, cousin. Cousin!

27:48.720 --> 27:50.440
I'm too busy. I have accounts to settle.

27:51.040 --> 27:53.240
Cousin, Mr. Du is so troubled.

27:53.320 --> 27:55.080
Help him out. Come on.

27:55.160 --> 27:57.160
No. I've offended Kangning for his sake!

27:57.240 --> 27:59.560
I swore not to meddle.

28:00.400 --> 28:02.920
Cousin, it was your trouble
with the marriage

28:03.000 --> 28:04.960
that dragged Mr. Du into this mess.

28:05.040 --> 28:06.200
You left him behind now.

28:06.280 --> 28:07.520
Where's your conscience?

28:07.600 --> 28:08.880
Am I wrong?

28:08.960 --> 28:10.040
Come. Come on.

28:10.120 --> 28:11.640
Sit.

28:12.920 --> 28:14.160
Have a seat.

28:16.800 --> 28:20.000
I, Du Yangxi, may be humble,

28:21.160 --> 28:23.640
but I have my pride.

28:23.720 --> 28:24.960
Since I was young,

28:25.040 --> 28:27.080
I never lowered my head

28:27.160 --> 28:29.520
and never submitted to anyone.

28:29.600 --> 28:31.440
But for her, I've done so much,

28:31.520 --> 28:32.960
treading carefully,

28:33.040 --> 28:35.800
afraid to displease her.

28:36.400 --> 28:38.000
Laugh if you like,

28:38.760 --> 28:43.000
but now I check her mood before I speak.

28:44.720 --> 28:46.160
You don't know how bitter it is.

28:49.680 --> 28:53.000
You all know about her first husband.

28:56.360 --> 28:58.600
I heard Fuhui mention him.

28:59.760 --> 29:00.960
He's gone now.

29:01.040 --> 29:02.280
Why bring him up?

29:02.360 --> 29:03.600
Not another word.

29:05.680 --> 29:06.800
What did she say?

29:07.840 --> 29:09.920
Just endless praise.

29:10.000 --> 29:13.120
How graceful, how talented.

29:13.200 --> 29:15.600
Without his illness, he was perfect.

29:15.680 --> 29:17.400
She even said,

29:17.480 --> 29:21.120
tie the three of us together and weigh us,

29:21.200 --> 29:24.280
we'd still fall short by an ounce.

29:24.360 --> 29:25.960
Doesn't that just make your blood boil?

29:26.040 --> 29:27.400
- Really?
- Yes.

29:27.480 --> 29:29.280
I've never heard Kangning mention this.

29:29.360 --> 29:31.520
He worried that Shouhua was lonely

29:31.600 --> 29:33.840
and often invited her sisters over.

29:33.920 --> 29:37.640
Kangning learned zither from her father
but stopped practicing.

29:37.720 --> 29:41.960
She resumed after Shouhua joined
the Wu family. Mr. Wu found her a master.

29:42.040 --> 29:43.760
And when the Li family lost their lands,

29:43.840 --> 29:46.760
the Wu family helped fight the case
and got them back.

29:48.440 --> 29:50.120
He cared so much.

29:50.200 --> 29:51.640
It's no wonder she can't forget.

29:56.480 --> 29:59.160
Mr. Du, just teasing.

29:59.240 --> 30:00.360
He's gone.

30:00.440 --> 30:01.920
She can praise him however she likes.

30:02.520 --> 30:04.320
Right? It doesn't mean much now.

30:08.400 --> 30:09.400
Yuanming,

30:09.480 --> 30:12.880
they say men love the new,
women cling to the past.

30:12.960 --> 30:16.080
She's married to you
but still holds onto her first husband.

30:16.160 --> 30:18.520
It shows her loyalty and deep feelings.

30:18.600 --> 30:20.840
You've got to admire that.

30:20.920 --> 30:25.320
Treat her sincerely
and she'll come around.

30:25.400 --> 30:26.480
He's gone now.

30:26.560 --> 30:28.200
How can he compete with you?

30:29.480 --> 30:31.240
If he were alive,

30:32.400 --> 30:34.640
I might have a chance to compete with him.

30:35.440 --> 30:36.880
But now,

30:38.240 --> 30:41.080
who can win a deceased darling husband
in her heart?

30:41.160 --> 30:44.360
If he lived, would it be your turn?

30:45.280 --> 30:46.400
Cousin!

30:56.200 --> 30:58.080
Chou'er, who told you to clean up?

31:00.160 --> 31:02.680
It's that meddling Chunlai.

31:02.760 --> 31:05.320
My lady,
Master drank too much at Pan Restaurant.

31:05.400 --> 31:07.000
No one could stop him.

31:07.080 --> 31:08.880
- Master.
- Come in, quickly!

31:08.960 --> 31:10.480
Careful now.

31:10.560 --> 31:11.640
Come, quickly!

31:12.320 --> 31:13.480
Hurry, get him in.

31:13.560 --> 31:14.760
Lend a hand.

31:28.080 --> 31:29.360
Master?

31:36.320 --> 31:37.600
Tell me.

31:37.680 --> 31:40.120
How am I worse than him?

31:41.000 --> 31:42.360
Tell me.

31:42.880 --> 31:44.480
Tell me.

32:49.640 --> 32:50.680
Master.

32:52.120 --> 32:53.480
Do you despise me?

32:54.200 --> 32:56.320
What nonsense.

32:56.400 --> 32:58.240
Who'd despise the third-ranked scholar?

32:59.280 --> 33:01.120
I'm no third-ranked scholar.

33:04.320 --> 33:06.600
I'm just an orphan with no parents.

33:09.280 --> 33:10.760
I survived a shipwreck,

33:12.440 --> 33:14.960
drifted ashore in a wooden tub.

33:17.400 --> 33:19.400
A kind washerwoman found me

33:20.240 --> 33:21.520
and took me in.

33:24.360 --> 33:26.880
The villagers called me cursed from birth.

33:27.760 --> 33:29.280
She took in a cursed star like me.

33:29.840 --> 33:32.400
She endured gossip, scorn from her kin,

33:32.480 --> 33:34.880
and rejection from her husband.

33:35.800 --> 33:37.960
Yet, she raised me to adulthood.

33:38.640 --> 33:40.880
I can't compare to Wu Shiyi.

33:41.600 --> 33:45.240
I have no noble family,
no lofty character,

33:45.320 --> 33:46.960
and I lack his generosity of spirit.

33:47.920 --> 33:52.360
I'm selfish, greedy, and petty.

33:58.880 --> 34:00.200
I wanted to excel in the exams.

34:01.760 --> 34:04.160
I wanted the world to see

34:04.760 --> 34:06.400
that even an orphan

34:07.080 --> 34:08.720
could achieve greatness

34:09.960 --> 34:11.560
and honor his name.

34:11.640 --> 34:13.200
I wanted them to know

34:14.240 --> 34:16.560
that the washerwoman they pitied

34:17.760 --> 34:21.360
would one day be a Noble Lady.

34:22.200 --> 34:25.560
But in doing so,
I failed to be a true gentleman.

34:26.160 --> 34:30.520
Is this why you don't want me,

34:31.800 --> 34:32.880
Shouhua?

34:40.880 --> 34:43.000
How could I not want you?

34:44.680 --> 34:46.640
Others say you're sophisticated and deep,

34:47.200 --> 34:49.040
but I see all your goodness.

34:50.320 --> 34:52.320
They never suffered your hardships.

34:52.400 --> 34:57.320
How could they know
the wisdom born of pain?

34:59.440 --> 35:01.200
But you avoid me.

35:01.840 --> 35:03.160
When have I?

35:04.480 --> 35:09.560
I thought couples should live
with respect and politeness

35:09.640 --> 35:11.200
to last long,

35:11.880 --> 35:15.800
but I didn't know what you truly wanted.

35:18.040 --> 35:21.200
Liang Hong and Meng Guang
are polite and diplomatic in marriage.

35:21.800 --> 35:23.880
I don't want to be a distant husband.

35:24.760 --> 35:26.600
I don't want your constant respect,

35:26.680 --> 35:28.520
keeping your distance. I want…

35:31.640 --> 35:33.040
your kiss.

35:47.640 --> 35:49.840
Fine. You can let me go now.

35:50.920 --> 35:52.200
You're lying again.

35:53.160 --> 35:56.520
But the hangover soup is getting cold.

35:58.280 --> 36:03.240
Then tell me one thing about me
that's better than him.

36:06.800 --> 36:09.200
You're sharper than him,

36:10.040 --> 36:13.240
even pretending to be drunk and foolish.

36:28.280 --> 36:29.440
Shouhua,

36:30.080 --> 36:31.440
please love me dearly.

36:32.160 --> 36:33.600
Don't avoid me.

36:47.000 --> 36:48.040
Come in.

37:02.200 --> 37:04.840
Master, Master Sang couldn't wait

37:04.920 --> 37:06.720
and has gone to the scholarly assembly.

37:06.800 --> 37:08.760
He asked me to inform you.

37:09.640 --> 37:10.720
I see.

37:11.960 --> 37:12.920
You may leave.

37:27.280 --> 37:29.680
You got up early to paint.

37:29.760 --> 37:31.160
What is it?

37:48.080 --> 37:49.440
When did you hide it?

37:49.520 --> 37:52.160
Hand it over before someone laughs.

37:52.240 --> 37:55.040
Painting landscapes is a refined art.

37:56.120 --> 37:59.080
Only the impure would think otherwise.

37:59.760 --> 38:02.240
Masterpieces hang in grand halls.

38:02.320 --> 38:03.440
Why not my wife?

38:03.520 --> 38:04.680
Who dares mock that?

38:05.520 --> 38:07.520
Don't keep it hidden.

38:07.600 --> 38:08.680
Wear it often.

38:09.440 --> 38:12.320
Then my midnight effort
won't be wasted.

38:13.480 --> 38:15.560
- It's not proper.
- I don't want you to be proper.

38:17.000 --> 38:18.280
Don't think I don't know.

38:19.000 --> 38:20.880
You copy scriptures daily

38:20.960 --> 38:22.160
to pray for him.

38:23.040 --> 38:24.200
Shouhua,

38:24.880 --> 38:27.000
I don't want you live in the past.

38:27.600 --> 38:30.240
I want you to know that you're my wife,

38:31.320 --> 38:32.720
not someone's widow.

38:33.880 --> 38:35.000
Do you understand?

38:36.000 --> 38:37.040
I do.

38:37.720 --> 38:38.840
When I'm away,

38:38.920 --> 38:40.920
think of me while painting.

38:41.000 --> 38:42.560
Remember me while embroidering.

38:43.200 --> 38:46.680
If you're upset,
curse me, scold me. I'd still be glad.

38:47.400 --> 38:48.440
Okay.

38:48.520 --> 38:49.800
I'll do as you say.

38:50.800 --> 38:52.000
Now, will you give it to me?

38:55.400 --> 38:58.200
Then, if you married someone else,

38:58.280 --> 38:59.560
would you obey him like this?

38:59.640 --> 39:03.320
What if Sang Yanrang
fainted before your sedan,

39:03.400 --> 39:04.600
would you marry him too?

39:05.240 --> 39:06.560
That's nonsense.

39:06.640 --> 39:07.760
Don't say such things!

39:09.560 --> 39:10.920
Even if it were him,

39:11.000 --> 39:12.400
I'd still win you over anyway!

39:12.480 --> 39:13.600
Let him keep dreaming.

39:14.200 --> 39:16.080
Why are you acting crazy so early?

39:16.160 --> 39:18.240
Stop it! Hand it over.

39:18.880 --> 39:20.400
Come on. Give it to me!

39:21.000 --> 39:22.160
Master.

39:25.920 --> 39:26.920
What now?

39:28.160 --> 39:32.160
The mistress says it's almost sunrise,

39:32.240 --> 39:33.400
time for breakfast.

39:34.600 --> 39:35.600
I'll come at once.

39:35.680 --> 39:36.760
Go and prepare.

39:37.560 --> 39:38.640
Understood.

39:48.080 --> 39:49.280
Are you happy now?

39:50.040 --> 39:51.120
This is so embarrassing!

39:51.200 --> 39:52.760
Shouhua, are you upset?

39:54.480 --> 39:55.600
I was wrong, Shouhua!

39:56.640 --> 39:59.480
Dear guest, take a look.

40:02.160 --> 40:03.320
Here you go!

40:07.160 --> 40:10.120
Master Liu,
we've got fine Jian Tea in stock.

40:10.200 --> 40:11.320
- Come in for a cup.
- Tomorrow.

40:11.400 --> 40:12.560
- I'll come tomorrow!
- A cup.

40:12.640 --> 40:14.320
It won't take long.

40:14.400 --> 40:15.560
Tomorrow, I promise!

40:15.640 --> 40:17.360
Miss, take a look at these flowers!

40:17.440 --> 40:18.320
Master Wang,

40:18.400 --> 40:21.160
Master Liu, try some herbal tea!

40:21.240 --> 40:23.160
One sip will refresh you

40:23.240 --> 40:26.560
and keep you energized all day.

40:26.640 --> 40:28.400
Master Liu, how about a cup?

40:28.480 --> 40:29.320
Come, come!

40:29.400 --> 40:30.480
Here. This way, please!

40:30.560 --> 40:32.040
Please, hurry inside!

40:32.120 --> 40:33.240
Slow down. Careful!

40:34.600 --> 40:35.880
Tomorrow, tomorrow!

40:36.840 --> 40:37.880
Two guests,

40:37.960 --> 40:39.720
come in for some herbal tea!

40:40.960 --> 40:42.920
- That's her.
- Hurry in, Come on!

40:43.000 --> 40:45.160
Everyone inside, work quickly!

40:45.240 --> 40:47.120
Treat them well!

40:47.200 --> 40:49.400
Mother, it's just down the street.

40:49.480 --> 40:52.440
Her tender mutton with chilled noodles
is truly unmatched!

40:52.520 --> 40:54.320
They've stolen so much of our business!

40:54.400 --> 40:57.200
All that, just for the noodles?

40:57.280 --> 40:58.840
Look at him. His eyes

40:59.440 --> 41:01.960
are about to fall into the soup!
Might as well cook them too!

41:03.160 --> 41:04.080
Mother,

41:04.160 --> 41:06.200
I may not serve tea as well as Kangning,

41:06.800 --> 41:07.920
but I'm decent enough.

41:08.000 --> 41:09.480
- Why don't I join?
- Nonsense!

41:10.960 --> 41:12.680
The shop's struggling.

41:12.760 --> 41:14.600
I only asked you to help for a few days.

41:14.680 --> 41:16.400
We're not that desperate!

41:16.480 --> 41:18.840
Why throw yourself
into a crowd of stinking men?

41:19.560 --> 41:21.560
Don't you want a good husband someday?

41:24.640 --> 41:25.800
Ah, here you are.

41:25.880 --> 41:27.160
Look at that shameless fool!

41:27.240 --> 41:29.400
- Please.
- Let's see how long her pride lasts.

41:29.480 --> 41:30.680
Exactly.

41:30.760 --> 41:31.640
Alright, go back.

41:31.720 --> 41:33.360
You go inside first.

41:33.440 --> 41:34.280
This one's lovely,

41:34.360 --> 41:36.000
- and the color is so vibrant!
- Yes.

41:36.080 --> 41:36.920
This one's nice too.

41:37.440 --> 41:38.680
I'll take it!

41:38.760 --> 41:41.200
UNIQUE CHILLED NOODLES

41:41.280 --> 41:42.120
Why are you here?

41:42.200 --> 41:44.000
I'm here for you, Dear Rong.

41:48.240 --> 41:49.840
Mother!

41:49.920 --> 41:50.960
You!

41:51.040 --> 41:52.880
Have some respect! What are you doing?

41:54.400 --> 41:55.920
It's been a while, Dear Rong.

41:56.000 --> 41:57.560
You've grown prettier.

41:59.240 --> 42:02.920
Good girl, have you missed me?

42:03.000 --> 42:04.560
Come. Come here!

42:04.640 --> 42:05.880
We're doing business here.

42:06.680 --> 42:09.080
Take your money and go gamble!

42:09.160 --> 42:10.240
Stop pestering her!

42:10.920 --> 42:12.080
Leave now!

42:12.160 --> 42:14.160
I'll come back tonight when I win.

42:14.240 --> 42:15.240
Go on!

42:16.040 --> 42:17.120
Wait for me!

42:20.960 --> 42:23.240
You never should've adopted that fool.

42:23.320 --> 42:25.040
He angered Father into illness,

42:25.120 --> 42:26.320
and he bothers us every day.

42:27.200 --> 42:28.720
It's your fault for lacking ability.

42:28.800 --> 42:31.160
Why don't you find me
a third-ranked scholar son-in-law?

42:31.240 --> 42:33.240
Do I have to keep swallowing this shame?

42:34.400 --> 42:36.880
No matter how capable they are,
they're not from my womb.

42:36.960 --> 42:38.320
Even if I'm not the best,

42:38.400 --> 42:40.200
you'll rely on me when you're old.

42:40.280 --> 42:42.360
If you keep scolding me, I'm done!

42:44.000 --> 42:46.720
You little brat, you're driving me crazy!

42:46.800 --> 42:47.880
CUI TEAHOUSE

42:47.960 --> 42:49.160
Master Wang,

42:49.240 --> 42:52.160
been drinking again, haven't you?

42:52.240 --> 42:53.560
You guessed it!

42:55.080 --> 42:57.160
- Where's Dear Rong?
- Inside, of course.

42:57.240 --> 42:58.800
Here, have some Er Chen Soup.

42:58.880 --> 43:00.640
It's just right.

43:00.720 --> 43:02.240
- Alright, alright!
- Please.

43:02.320 --> 43:03.680
Come in!

43:04.560 --> 43:06.040
Taoist Ritual is done today.

43:06.120 --> 43:07.880
You've fulfilled your duty.

43:07.960 --> 43:10.680
Mr. Du is drowning his sorrows
at Pan Restaurant.

43:11.440 --> 43:12.920
If Fan Lianghan comes back,

43:13.000 --> 43:14.800
he'll claim that Shouhua bullied him.

43:17.120 --> 43:18.320
If you ask me,

43:18.400 --> 43:21.000
Shouhua should go back
and coax him a little.

43:21.840 --> 43:23.440
He's a third-ranked scholar after all,

43:23.520 --> 43:26.240
a husband so many in the capital envy!

43:28.920 --> 43:30.680
He's ridiculous.

43:30.760 --> 43:32.360
That one's been gone for years!

43:32.440 --> 43:34.920
Still jealous over someone who died young.

43:35.520 --> 43:36.920
And Shouhua has to comfort him.

43:38.160 --> 43:39.120
Such a petty man.

43:39.800 --> 43:41.760
I used to think marriage

43:41.840 --> 43:43.400
was just companionship

43:43.480 --> 43:44.800
to pass the days peacefully.

43:44.880 --> 43:46.680
Who'd have thought he'd be so tender,

43:46.760 --> 43:47.960
so affectionate,

43:48.040 --> 43:49.320
so devoted?

43:49.400 --> 43:51.760
All his thoughts are on me.

43:52.840 --> 43:57.640
Honestly,
sometimes I'm scared when I see him.

43:57.720 --> 43:59.080
Scared of what?

44:00.200 --> 44:02.200
Scared he'll grow cold,

44:02.280 --> 44:03.520
that he'll be disappointed.

44:04.680 --> 44:07.200
Scared I'm not as good as he thinks.

44:08.320 --> 44:10.680
Shouhua, you're already the best.

44:17.160 --> 44:18.520
But honestly,

44:18.600 --> 44:20.680
those three brothers-in-law are too close.

44:21.560 --> 44:25.000
We need to break them up somehow
or they'll keep causing trouble.

44:25.600 --> 44:27.880
Shouhua, don't you agree?

44:28.680 --> 44:30.560
Yes, you're right.

44:31.240 --> 44:32.880
What's wrong? What are you looking at?

44:34.120 --> 44:35.320
Don't look.

44:46.200 --> 44:47.520
Madam, are you feeling warm?

44:48.400 --> 44:49.760
I'm fine. No worries.

44:51.360 --> 44:54.920
Lianghan, Fuhui is with child now.

44:55.000 --> 44:58.200
From now on, drink and gamble less

44:58.280 --> 45:00.400
and stay home with her more.

45:00.480 --> 45:01.920
Just keep her happy.

45:02.000 --> 45:04.160
- Alright.
- Young couples are like that.

45:04.240 --> 45:06.440
Who hasn't had their ups and downs?

45:06.520 --> 45:09.240
Why scold you and not others?

45:10.160 --> 45:12.520
Because she cares for you.

45:12.600 --> 45:14.120
Yes, yes.

45:14.200 --> 45:15.480
Don't worry, madam.

45:15.560 --> 45:17.600
I know my wife loves me most.

45:17.680 --> 45:20.400
Yes, she scolds you because she cares.

45:20.480 --> 45:22.840
She just wants the best for you, right?

45:22.920 --> 45:23.920
They've arrived.

45:24.000 --> 45:25.560
- Mistress, they're back.
- I'll go.

45:26.800 --> 45:29.880
Chunlai, serve two melons.

45:29.960 --> 45:31.080
Got it!

45:32.240 --> 45:33.400
- Kangning.
- Go fetch your wife.

45:33.480 --> 45:34.480
Okay.

45:38.960 --> 45:40.720
- Fuhui, careful, I'll help you.
- Alright.

45:41.560 --> 45:43.160
Come. Take it slow.

45:43.240 --> 45:44.480
Here.

45:44.560 --> 45:45.720
Hurry, come in!

45:45.800 --> 45:47.960
The sun is too harsh. Go inside quickly.

45:48.040 --> 45:49.400
Lianghan sent over

45:49.480 --> 45:51.040
some plums and white peaches.

45:51.120 --> 45:52.480
Go inside and enjoy them.

45:52.560 --> 45:55.320
Chunlai, cut two big, sweet ones.

45:55.400 --> 45:57.720
Not the chilled ones!

45:57.800 --> 45:59.240
The well-chilled ones aren't good.

45:59.320 --> 46:00.840
Fuhui can't have them.

46:02.960 --> 46:04.200
Madam.

46:07.600 --> 46:09.160
That wretch won't go away.

46:09.240 --> 46:11.440
Who knows who he's targeting now?

46:13.280 --> 46:16.960
Mr. Du is a scholar, not a fighter.
How could he scare anyone?

46:17.040 --> 46:18.120
Don't worry, madam.

46:18.200 --> 46:20.040
I'll deal with him.

46:20.120 --> 46:22.760
I'll make sure
he won't dare show his face here again.

46:22.840 --> 46:24.640
Yes, teach him a lesson.

46:24.720 --> 46:26.280
Don't go easy on him.

46:26.360 --> 46:28.200
Even if he dies, he deserves it.

46:28.280 --> 46:29.320
Yes!

46:29.400 --> 46:31.400
- Let's go.
- Okay, madam.

46:47.640 --> 46:48.720
So what if he has a title?

46:48.800 --> 46:50.600
Your crimes will be exposed in court.

46:50.680 --> 46:52.360
Forget becoming an official.

46:52.440 --> 46:54.400
You'll lose everything, even your life.

46:54.480 --> 46:56.160
I spared you,
and you still harass the Li family?

46:56.240 --> 46:57.640
Risking your life for lust?

46:57.720 --> 46:59.200
I'm going home to mourn.

46:59.280 --> 47:01.200
I've said goodbye to Shouhua.
I won't come again.

47:01.280 --> 47:03.880
Nonsense! You scoundrel, still lying!

47:03.960 --> 47:05.120
Get out, now!

47:05.200 --> 47:06.480
See you again, and I'll beat you!

47:13.880 --> 47:14.960
Let's go!

50:07.320 --> 50:10.760
Subtitle translation by: Jiayi Xu
